                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Minister Bowen.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1905-02-13"><hi rendition="#italic">February 13,
                        1905</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Hay instructs that no action be taken in Critchfield or the United States
                    and Venezuelan Company case until further instructed.)</p>
